  Prompt ==> Ag
  Ag ==> Rag ==> Annot ==> Llm ==> Ext ==> Val
  Val -->|faltam campos| Drop
  Val -->|ok| Forbid
  Forbid -->|sim| Drop
  Forbid -->|não| Pack ==> Db ==> Unp ==> Ui
  Prompt ~~~ Note
  Note -.-> Val
